@Recipes_HostAddress = http://localhost:5184

### Login (devolve accessToken e refreshToken)
# @name login
POST {{Recipes_HostAddress}}/api/Account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seu-email@exemplo.com",
  "password": "sua-senha"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Listar receitas
GET {{Recipes_HostAddress}}/api/Recipe
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Buscar receita por id
GET {{Recipes_HostAddress}}/api/Recipe/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Esqueci minha senha (sempre 204; envia email com link se o usuario existir)
POST {{Recipes_HostAddress}}/api/Account/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seu-email@exemplo.com"
}

### Redefinir senha com o token recebido no email
POST {{Recipes_HostAddress}}/api/Account/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token-do-link",
  "newPassword": "nova-senha"
}
